  "releaseNotes": "version 1.0.0\ninitial implementation\n---\nversion 2.0.0\nsimplified reqirements for subcontainer resolve\nadded builders\nmove from installers to Autofac's modules\n---\nversion 2.0.1\nbugfix wrong order of IDisposables execution when harmony patched\n---\nversion 2.0.2\nMove to IDisposer interface\n---\nversion 2.0.3\nfix keyfilter not working for factorie",
